Task8  1274.329   231.485   236.846     2.607  -470.683  1042.683  3132.896  3833.375  7222.307

Scaling

So I tried re-scaling the dataset with different scalers (see data.scale2). After doing this both models converged with no warnings. Following is the new covariance matrix with data.scale2.

data.scale2 <- read.delim("…/data.scale2.txt", header=FALSE)

names(data.scale2)<- c("ID","Task1","Task2","Task3","Task4","Task5","Task6","Task7","Task8","Task9")

> fit.model.fix.loading <- cfa(model,estimator = "mlm",data = data.scale2)

> fit.model.fix.variance <- cfa(model,estimator = "mlm",data = data.scale2,std.lv <http://std.lv> = TRUE)
$cov
