Thanks for your quick responses! I reformulated the models according to your advice:

HS.model <- '
    visual  =~ x1 + x2 + x3
    textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6
speed   =~ x7 + x8 + x9
'
HS.model_2 <- '
    visual  =~ x1 + x2 + x3
    textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6
    speed   =~ x7 + x8 + x9

    visual ~~ 1*textual
    visual ~~ 1*speed
    textual ~~ 1*speed
