Subject: Growth Curve Analyses: Different results in lavaan versus Mplus
Message-ID: <il15axLzOaE.Xr5EnXv6WLYJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/il15axLzOaE/m/Xr5EnXv6WLYJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
