Subject: Growth Curve Analyses: Different results in lavaan versus Mplus
Message-ID: <KX8lAgLpVEI.ljP-_-0QAGMJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/KX8lAgLpVEI/m/ljP-_-0QAGMJ>
